# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Old domain → new domain. Cloudflare's "Bulk Redirects" or a Workers
# rule can also handle host-level redirects, but Pages also honours
# this _redirects file at the dist root for path-level rules. Host-
# level redirect (apex korehannews.com → korehani.com) lives in the
# Cloudflare dashboard under the old zone's rules.
#
# Format: /from /to status

# Legacy paths from the korehannews.com era — not strictly redirects,
# but explicit so any old bookmarks or shared links that include
# /korehan/* prefixes still land correctly.
/korehan/*       /:splat       301

# Trailing-slash → no slash for the article reader URLs (some shared
# links include them).
/korehan-article/  /korehan-article.html  301
